{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-7v24-42x9-pxf7","cve_id":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security-advisories/GHSA-7v24-42x9-pxf7","html_url":"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-7v24-42x9-pxf7","summary":"Panic on erroneous call-to-host from guest realloc call","description":"### Impact\r\n\r\nThe `may_leave` flag is not cleared when calling `realloc` for the lowering of `stream` or `future` results. A Wasm module may then trigger a host panic during `realloc`. The root cause of this is that certain states of the `Store` are invalid when Wasm is calling into the host and these states are not properly enforced when running `realloc` because it should not be able to call back into the host. Some examples of ways a panic could be triggered are by cancelling the `read` that is currently being lowered or calling `waitable-set.wait` on a set that is already being waited on. All wasmtime versions >= 46.0.0 (or older versions which enabled `component-model-async`) are impacted.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\nThe fix is present in main and patch releases are made for 48.0.6 and 49.0.3.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nThere are no known workarounds.","severity":"medium","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"alexcrichton","id":64996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton","html_url":"https://github.com/alexcrichton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexcrichton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-7v24-42x9-pxf7","type":"GHSA"}],"state":"published","created_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:26:29Z","published_at":"2026-10-14T17:26:28Z","closed_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"submission":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"rust","name":"wasmtime"},"vulnerable_version_range":">= 46.0.0, < 48.0.6, >= 49.0.0, < 49.0.3","patched_versions":"48.0.6, 49.0.3","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L","score":5.3},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":null}},"cwes":[],"cwe_ids":[],"credits":[{"login":"tschneidereit","type":"finder"}],"credits_detailed":[{"user":{"login":"tschneidereit","id":56359,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MzU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit","html_url":"https://github.com/tschneidereit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tschneidereit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"type":"finder","state":"accepted"}],"collaborating_users":null,"collaborating_teams":null,"private_fork":null